  leaf_first_ladder_order
    defined-by code
    role coding_search_literal_query
    role coding_experiment_artifact_kind
    precondition "a workspace-inspection request asks whether verified leaves execute before composite parents"
    effect "the repository-search subject is bound to the ladder's leaf-first all-mode ordering"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "atomic leaves run before composite parents"
    lexeme en
      words "ladder can execute the 32 smallest leaves before moving to larger composite nodes"
      words "atomic leaves run before composite parents" "ladder order for all mode is 32, 16, 8, 4, 2, then the root"
      words "all-mode traversal visits depth five through depth zero in descending order"
      action leaf_first_ladder_order
    lexeme ru "атомарные листья выполняются раньше составных родителей"
      action leaf_first_ladder_order
    lexeme hi "परमाणु पत्ते संयुक्त माता-पिता से पहले चलते हैं"
      action leaf_first_ladder_order
    lexeme zh 原子叶子先于复合父节点执行
      action leaf_first_ladder_order
    lexeme es "las hojas atómicas se ejecutan antes que los padres compuestos"
      action leaf_first_ladder_order
